╭─ Permissions ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── solo-indie ─╮
│                                                                              │
│ PERMISSION PROFILE                                                           │
│                                                                              │
│    Not set    use the permissions of my original setup                       │
│    Careful    asks before most actions and never reads your .env files       │
│  ▸ Balanced   edits files freely, still asks before git push (current)       │
│    Autopilot  a classifier approves safe actions, so there are few prompts   │
│    Custom…    write the allow, ask and deny rules myself                     │
│                                                                              │
│ WHAT IT SETS                                                                 │
│   defaultMode  acceptEdits                                                   │
│   ask          Bash(git push *)                                              │
